    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:5acd1ff62dd7566b",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "20bc1fe3e6e86704e9635ef97ecec3268201468626243ff00bd788dd25a992ea",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-3d74c885-ec18-44c9-816e-dfc3b1075fc2",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "Breakfast. Your Cusco sightseeing tour begins in the afternoon. The city preserves both Inca structures and Spanish colonial architecture.\n\nThe first stop is Qorikancha, the Temple of the Sun. At this religious centre, the Incas held ceremonies in honour of the Sun, including celebrations of the winter solstice.\n\nYou then visit four archaeological sites outside the city. At Sacsayhuamán, you’ll see massive walls, terraces and the remains of towers, with enormous stone blocks fitted together with remarkable precision. At Q’enqo, rock-cut passages, niches and ritual areas survive. Puka Pukara, the ‘Red Fortress’, is thought to have served defensive and administrative purposes. At Tambomachay, stone channels, terraces and flowing water show how the Incas built structures linked to the worship of water."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:91653954c27b25a7",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "84fc948887503a15e64028db23ea0efb68da48ddb0749f348cf6351f389377de",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-3d74c885-ec18-44c9-816e-dfc3b1075fc2",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "Before the main sightseeing tour, you can visit Cusco Cathedral and see its collection of religious art. The visit takes about 40 minutes and costs an additional $30 per person."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:97d149ee71d1d925",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "187fe93a81d344d99064ad30101fe5f0a515b568cecd059106791ac3427f6d4e",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-3d74c885-ec18-44c9-816e-dfc3b1075fc2",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "Overnight at the 4-star Xima Cusco or a similar hotel."
    },
